---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Sidebar from '../components/Sidebar.astro';
import Icons from '../components/Icons.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="M & A Advisory Solutions | Mergers, Acquisitions & Takeovers — Aakkam Corporate Solutions"
  description="Strategic M&A advisory, corporate takeover guidance, fair company valuation, transaction structuring, and deal closing support across Indian capital markets."
>

  <!-- Clean Light Header with Krasis Orange Accents -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-orange-50/60 via-white to-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200/80 py-12 sm:py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold tracking-wider uppercase bg-orange-100/80 text-brand-orange border border-orange-200 mb-4">
        Inorganic Growth
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        M & A Advisory Solutions
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Strategizing mergers, corporate takeovers, target valuation, and cross-border transaction execution.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-14">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-10 items-start">
      
      <main class="lg:col-span-8 bg-white p-6 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-6">
        
        <blockquote class="bg-orange-50/60 border-l-4 border-brand-orange p-6 rounded-r-2xl">
          <p class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 italic">
            “Whenever you see a successful business, someone once made a courageous decision”
          </p>
          <footer class="mt-2 text-xs font-bold text-brand-orange uppercase tracking-wider">
            — Peter F. Drucker
          </footer>
        </blockquote>

        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight pb-3 border-b border-slate-100">
          M & A Advisory Solutions
        </h2>

        <p class="text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-left">
          A high level of competitive pressure and an increasing appetite for growth have led firms across geographies and industries to choose the inorganic growth path. Mergers & Acquisitions and Takeovers provide a robust growth vehicle often best suited for such firms seeking an entry into a market, geography, product category or broadening its product and / or client base.
        </p>

        <p class="text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-left">
          In India, corporate houses have recently witnessed an increase of restructuring in different organizations. The main reasons for the sudden impetus to restructure in India are as follows: a) deshackling of strict regulatory provisions and new government policy of relicensing b) increased competition is another key element for giving rise to corporate restructuring. c) mounting pressure on margins have necessitated higher volume of business, resulting in mergers and acquisitions or the grand concentration of strategy has led to demergers of non profitable businesses, and d) all round resource optimization in existing businesses to streamline operational profit and to stay fit in competition.
        </p>

        <p class="text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-left">
          The specialized merger and acquisition team at Aakkam, through their understanding of the Indian Capital Markets- Evolution, Regulations & Regulatory bodies, Relationship with Intermediaries, and a strong research orientation, has developed a unique knowledge and capability infrastructure to help companies plan, design and execute their growth strategies. While maintaining the integrity and confidentiality of the clients we offer them the best of breed services relating to Mergers, Acquisitions and Takeovers.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 pt-2">Our M&A Services Include:</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs text-slate-700 pt-2">
          <div class="p-3.5 bg-orange-50/40 rounded-xl border border-orange-100 flex items-start gap-2">
            <Icons name="check" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-brand-orange shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>Assessing potential acquisition targets and providing valuation analysis</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3.5 bg-orange-50/40 rounded-xl border border-orange-100 flex items-start gap-2">
            <Icons name="check" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-brand-orange shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>Advising on transactions structuring, fund raising, or buy back repatriations</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3.5 bg-orange-50/40 rounded-xl border border-orange-100 flex items-start gap-2">
            <Icons name="check" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-brand-orange shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>Ensuring methodical and appropriate company valuation</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3.5 bg-orange-50/40 rounded-xl border border-orange-100 flex items-start gap-2">
            <Icons name="check" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-brand-orange shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>Comprehensive business and legal due diligence</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 flex items-start gap-2">
            <Icons name="check" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>Negotiating and consummating transactions</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 flex items-start gap-2">
            <Icons name="check" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>Providing special committee advisory and fair opinions</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 flex items-start gap-2">
            <Icons name="check" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>Advising on deal timing, pricing, and potential financing</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 flex items-start gap-2">
            <Icons name="check" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>Assisting in negotiating and closing the acquisition</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6 border-t border-slate-100 flex flex-wrap gap-4 items-center">
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold text-white bg-brand-orange hover:bg-brand-orangeHover shadow-md shadow-orange-500/20 active:scale-[0.98] transition-all"
          >
            <span>Initiate M & A Discussion</span>
            <Icons name="chevron-right" class="w-4 h-4" />
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/917010311971?text=Hello%20Aakkam%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20discuss%20mergers%20and%20acquisitions%20advisory."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2 px-5 py-3.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 hover:bg-emerald-100 border border-emerald-200 active:scale-[0.98] transition-all"
          >
            <Icons name="whatsapp" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600" />
            <span>Chat on WhatsApp</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </main>

      <div class="lg:col-span-4">
        <Sidebar currentPath="/advisory" />
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

</Layout>
